    "section": "06. Other Concepts",
    "ruleNumber": "06.02",
    "summary": "Resolve normal damage first when an attack also inflicts mortal wounds. Each mortal wound costs one wound without a save. Excess can carry over to another model unless the rule limits it to one model. Feel No Pain can still prevent these losses.",
